   "name": "Dispel Magic",
   "type": "spell",
   "img": "systems/arneyan/assets/icons/spell-magic-shield.svg",
   "system": {
    "description": "<p>Range <strong>120ft</strong>; one creature, object or <strong>20ft</strong>-radius area.</p><ul><li>Each ongoing spell effect there ends automatically if the spell's level is 3 or lower; for a higher level, make a casting check (<strong>d20</strong> + casting-stat modifier + half your level (minimum 1)) vs <strong>DC 10</strong> + the spell's level.</li><li>A magic item in the area is suppressed for <strong>1d4</strong> rounds if you succeed on a casting check against <strong>DC 10</strong> + its rarity (Uncommon 1, Rare 3, Very Rare 5); a worn or carried item uses its bearer's <strong>Will save</strong> instead.</li><li>Artefacts and Uniques are unaffected.</li></ul><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Classes:</strong> Wizard, Illusionist, Cleric, Warlock, Bard, Paladin, Spellblade, Witch</p>",
